# ETHOnline 2026 Partner Prizes

Source: https://ethglobal.com/events/ethonline2026/prizes  
Select **at most 3** partners on submission. One partner with multiple tracks still counts as 1 selection.

**Ether Hunt locked selection:** Hedera (x402) · The Graph (AI Use Case From Scratch) · Arc (Agent Stack). Do not add 1inch/Uniswap/World/Privy/Chainlink/Ledger/Bazantic as primary tracks unless the user explicitly changes this. **0G is not on the prize page — do not target it.**


Before claiming eligibility for a prize, satisfy that prize’s qualification checklist and document the integration in README (contracts/lines, architecture, payment/agent flows).

**Classic rule:** no product code in this repo before ETHOnline kickoff (2026-09-04). Docs/planning OK.

## Available now (details published)

### The Graph — $15,000
- **Composable / Standardized Graph Products ($5k)**: compose products or standardized schemas; live Graph provider data required.
- **Best AI Tooling or AI Use Case — From Scratch ($5k)**: **Classic-eligible.** AI tooling for Graph AI Suite and/or AI app/agent using Graph as live chain data. Mock/local/static-only data does not qualify.
- **Best AI Tooling or AI Use Case — Continuity ($5k)**: Continuity pool only.

### Hedera — $15,000
- **AI & Agentic Payments ($6k)**: live **x402-gated** service on Hedera testnet/mainnet via **Blocky402**; consumer agent/platform completes ≥1 real paid request; README + demo ≤5 min. Prefer metering, A2A/ACP, ERC-8004/HCS-14, UCP discovery, HTS fees, HCS audit, scheduled/streamed payments.
- **Improve Hedera Harness ($2k)**: meaningful harness PR or new harness on its foundations; README/PR + demo ≤5 min.
- **Tokenization of Anything ($6k)**: use **Asset Tokenization Studio**; deploy Hedera testnet; verified contracts on HashScan where applicable; demo issuance + ≥1 lifecycle op.
- **Continuity only ($1k)**: prior Hedera project + substantive new work (not polish-only); README separates old vs new.

### Arc — $10,000
- **Best DeFi stablecoin-native Pool ($2.5k)**: Arc + USDC DeFi / payments / treasury.
- **Best Agentic Economy with Circle Agent Stack ($2.5k)**: agents with wallets, USDC payments, Agent Stack / nanopayments — **Ether Hunt third-seat target**.
- **Launch on Mainnet ($5k)**: continuity / existing product shipping Arc mainnet by Sep 30 — not primary for Classic greenfield.

### World — $7,000
- **AgentKit Continuity ($3.5k, Continuity only)** · **Selfie Check ($3.5k)** — feedback docs required; not primary for Ether Hunt.

### 1inch — $7,000
- **Aqua / SwapVM** — not primary for Ether Hunt.

### ENS — $5,000
- **Best Use of ENSv2 ($4.5k)** on Sepolia — optional identity stretch, not locked seat.

### Uniswap Foundation — $5,000
- Requires **FEEDBACK.md** + feedback form — not primary.

